{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108323","id":2644002188,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6dmEWM","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108323","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108323.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108323.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108323","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108323/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108323/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108323/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/afdea8649a7fe69ed83deb5b7cdd924fa0f6df6a","number":108323,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add Stack class for LIFO data structure operations","user":{"login":"WebLDix","id":208256323,"node_id":"U_kgDODGm9Qw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/208256323?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WebLDix","html_url":"https://github.com/WebLDix","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WebLDix/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WebLDix/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WebLDix/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WebLDix/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WebLDix/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WebLDix/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WebLDix/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WebLDix/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WebLDix/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Adds a new Stack class that provides Last-In-First-Out (LIFO) data structure functionality to Godot, eliminating the need for developers to manually implement stack operations using Array.\r\n\r\n## Problem Solved\r\n- Developers frequently need to manually implement stack functionality using Array, leading to code duplication and potential errors\r\n- Lack of semantically clear stack operation APIs\r\n- No unified stack implementation standard, with every project \"reinventing the wheel\"\r\n\r\n## What this PR does\r\n- Implements a Stack class inheriting from RefCounted\r\n- Provides standard stack operations: push, pop, peek\r\n- Includes utility methods: is_empty, size, clear, to_array\r\n- Exposes all methods to GDScript through ClassDB bindings\r\n- Includes proper error handling for empty stack operations\r\n- Registers the Stack class in core types for engine integration\r\n\r\n## Use cases\r\n- Game state management (undo/redo systems)\r\n- Algorithm implementations requiring LIFO behavior\r\n- Call stack simulation\r\n- Backtracking algorithms\r\n- Any scenario requiring stack data structure without manually implementing it with Array\r\n\r\n## Implementation details\r\n- Uses Godot's Array as underlying storage for guaranteed performance\r\n- Follows Godot's coding conventions and error handling patterns\r\n- All methods are bound for GDScript access\r\n- Includes _to_string() for debugging support\r\n- Properly registered in register_core_types.cpp\r\n\r\n## Testing\r\n- [x] Compiles without errors\r\n- [x] Basic functionality tested (push/pop/peek)\r\n- [x] Error handling for empty stack operations\r\n- [x] Class registration verified\r\n\r\nSay goodbye to the era of reinventing stack wheels with Array!","labels":[{"id":73330068,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/feature%20proposal","name":"feature proposal","description":"","color":"4466ff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-07-05T23:27:21Z","updated_at":"2025-07-06T09:01:36Z","closed_at":"2025-07-06T08:03:26Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"783ffb85d367e68df7f99392c8014465852a1652","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"WebLDix:master","ref":"master","repo":null,"sha":"afdea8649a7fe69ed83deb5b7cdd924fa0f6df6a","user":{"login":"WebLDix","id":208256323,"node_id":"U_kgDODGm9Qw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/208256323?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WebLDix","html_url":"https://github.com/WebLDix","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WebLDix/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WebLDix/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WebLDix/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WebLDix/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WebLDix/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WebLDix/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WebLDix/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WebLDix/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WebLDix/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},"base":{"label":"godotengine:master","ref":"master","repo":{"id":15634981,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnkxNTYzNDk4MQ==","name":"godot","full_name":"godotengine/godot","owner":{"login":"godotengine","id":6318500,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjYzMTg1MDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.g